00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is... this place...?</font>

39
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it?</font>

40
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me...
from long ago?</font>

41
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father and mother didn't need to die!</font>

42
00:02:18,740 --> 00:02:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone was killed.</font>

43
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:24,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had no power so...</font>

44
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the clan vanished.</font>

45
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:47,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Ultimate Formation!</font>

46
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:47,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ino, Shika, Cho!!</font>

47
00:02:55,270 --> 00:02:57,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino... Why?</font>

48
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:03,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't let you upstage me
in front of Sasuke-kun!</font>

49
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:05,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Squirming again...</font>

50
00:03:06,450 --> 00:03:10,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village worms wandered in.</font>

51
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are the two of you thinking?!</font>

52
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're bad news!</font>

53
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pain, but it can't be helped!</font>

54
00:03:18,090 --> 00:03:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino steps out and
we men should run?</font>

55
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to get you involved.</font>

56
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But anyway we're
a Three-Man Squad, after all.</font>

57
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're all in this together, aren't we?</font>

58
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, we'll see.</font>

59
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I don't want to die yet!</font>

60
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go of my scarf!</font>

61
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're annoying! Quit wiggling!</font>

62
00:03:41,110 --> 00:03:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay for you to drop out, fatso.</font>

63
00:03:46,450 --> 00:03:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did that guy just say?</font>

64
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:52,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... didn't quite catch it.</font>

65
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

66
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That word is taboo to Choji.</font>

67
00:03:57,670 --> 00:03:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try saying it again...</font>

68
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:04,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said if you have a problem,
pull out, fatso.</font>

69
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fatso... fatso... fatso... fatso... fatso</font>

70
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not fat, I'm just big-boned!
Damn it!</font>

71
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurray for Big-Boned!</font>

72
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow...</font>

73
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:28,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! You understand this, right?!</font>

74
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a battle between Leaf and Sound!</font>

75
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky! He's lost it!</font>

76
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way, this looks like it's going
to be a pain in the butt.</font>

77
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my line.</font>

78
00:04:41,590 --> 00:04:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was told to get Sasuke
by the end of the test...</font>

79
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:48,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

80
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

81
00:04:51,930 --> 00:04:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The two behind...
take care of them.</font>

82
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

83
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:02,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, Team Ino,
let's go full throttle!</font>

84
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

85
00:05:04,650 --> 00:05:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Formation Ino!</font>

86
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Shika!
— Cho!</font>

87
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Choji!</font>

88
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

89
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

90
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:17,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, Leaf Style Taijutsu!</font>

91
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human Boulder!</font>

92
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this Jutsu?</font>

93
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it just a fat guy rolling?</font>

94
00:05:32,810 --> 00:05:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slicing Sound Wave!</font>

95
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

96
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He jumped?!</font>

97
00:05:58,670 --> 00:06:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The air pressure of
Slicing Sound Wave</font>

98
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:02,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is less than effective
against that rotation.</font>

99
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I do the Super Sound Wave,
if I'm touched by something like that</font>

100
00:06:06,550 --> 00:06:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the bones in my arms will be crushed!</font>

101
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think I'll let you?!</font>

102
00:06:15,810 --> 00:06:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the most annoying so...</font>

103
00:06:18,730 --> 00:06:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art!</font>

104
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:21,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu!</font>

105
00:06:25,990 --> 00:06:27,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body!</font>

106
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

107
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dosu?!</font>

108
00:06:39,870 --> 00:06:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing at a time like this?!</font>

109
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Paralysis Jutsu?</font>

110
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino, next it's just the ladies.</font>

111
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Shikamaru, look after my body.</font>

112
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Gotcha!
— Huh?</font>

113
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Mind Transfer Jutsu!</font>

114
00:07:12,570 --> 00:07:13,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

115
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kin!</font>

116
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

117
00:07:25,710 --> 00:07:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This... is the end of it.</font>

118
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys!</font>

119
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you make one move,
this girl named Kin is dead meat!</font>

120
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want this
to end right here,</font>

121
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">leave your scroll and walk away!</font>

122
00:07:37,850 --> 00:07:40,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once you've gone far enough that
I can't feel your Chakras,</font>

123
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll release this girl!</font>

124
00:07:44,150 --> 00:07:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys...
What are they grinning about?</font>

125
00:07:47,530 --> 00:07:49,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Choji!
— Yeah!</font>

126
00:07:49,650 --> 00:07:51,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good! They won't...!</font>

127
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino!</font>

128
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:02,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ugh. I'm dizzy.</font>

129
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What kind of person...
hurts their own comrades?</font>

130
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Careless.</font>

131
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our goal is not the scrolls or
to pass this test playing by the rules.</font>

132
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:22,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

133
00:08:22,690 --> 00:08:24,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Sasuke-kun</font>

134
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph...</font>

135
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:36,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Jutsu...</font>

136
00:08:36,370 --> 00:08:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So your much precious
Shadow Paralysis Jutsu</font>

137
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is limited to 5 minutes?</font>

138
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not Shadow Paralysis.
It's Shadow Possession Jutsu.</font>

139
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:47,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition, it seems that
this girl's Jutsu...</font>

140
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seems to be a Jutsu to
take over the other's body.</font>

141
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the looks of the blood
she's spitting up,</font>

142
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I kill Kin, that girl will die too...</font>

143
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to do in...
your teammate?</font>

144
00:09:03,060 --> 00:09:05,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I need to...</font>

145
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no good.</font>

146
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap...</font>

147
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's too bad...
you're just a step away.</font>

148
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too easy-going.</font>

149
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph, I don't like this at all.</font>

150
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You minor Sound Ninja...</font>

151
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bullying the second-rate guys and
putting on airs like a winner.</font>

152
00:09:31,460 --> 00:09:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

153
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're Lee-san's teammates...</font>

154
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

155
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You goofed.</font>

156
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! Coming out of nowhere
like cockroaches...</font>

157
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid with the bowl cut lying over there
is on our team, but...</font>

158
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you messed with him, didn't you?!</font>

159
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with his eyes?</font>

160
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like they see through everything...</font>

161
00:10:12,290 --> 00:10:15,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're gonna continue,
I'll fight with full strength!</font>

162
00:10:17,130 --> 00:10:17,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

163
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong? Neji...</font>

164
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Chakra...</font>

165
00:10:23,970 --> 00:10:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't like me,
don't play cool, come down here.</font>

166
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:32,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. Evidently, there's no need for that.</font>

167
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all...</font>

168
00:10:56,710 --> 00:10:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without power...</font>

169
00:10:59,010 --> 00:11:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't do anything!</font>

170
00:11:02,930 --> 00:11:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I had no power...
Everyone was killed!</font>

171
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...
You let them be killed.</font>

172
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You only... watched.</font>

173
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If only I had power...</font>

174
00:11:23,990 --> 00:11:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If only I had power...</font>

175
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun! You're awake...
Huh?!</font>

176
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

177
00:11:49,100 --> 00:11:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

178
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:51,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?</font>

179
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

180
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

181
00:12:31,770 --> 00:12:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who did this to you?</font>

182
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:37,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it?</font>

183
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Marks run
around his entire body?!</font>

184
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...
That body...?</font>

185
00:12:59,210 --> 00:13:00,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.</font>

186
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the contrary,
strength is rapidly flowing in...</font>

187
00:13:05,010 --> 00:13:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now I feel good.</font>

188
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:09,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy gave this to me.</font>

189
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

190
00:13:11,020 --> 00:13:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last I understand...</font>

191
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:15,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm an Avenger...</font>

192
00:13:16,690 --> 00:13:19,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On my road, I must put power
into my hands...</font>

193
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if it means abandoning
myself to the devil.</font>

194
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... I see...</font>

195
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the mark on the neck
that this girl called Sakura spoke of</font>

196
00:13:34,790 --> 00:13:37,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is this Curse Mark.</font>

197
00:13:37,830 --> 00:13:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

198
00:13:39,210 --> 00:13:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think he could stand up...</font>

199
00:13:42,130 --> 00:13:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, tell me...</font>

200
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who harmed you...?</font>

201
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me!</font>

202
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

203
00:13:55,270 --> 00:13:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino!</font>

204
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you stay like that
you're gonna get involved!</font>

205
00:13:58,900 --> 00:14:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come back to this body!</font>

206
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:03,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, you too,
come over here and hide.</font>

207
00:14:03,110 --> 00:14:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah.</font>

208
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-oh.</font>

209
00:14:06,650 --> 00:14:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release!</font>

210
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, she's back!</font>

211
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

212
00:14:13,790 --> 00:14:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going to happen now?</font>

213
00:14:16,250 --> 00:14:17,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How should I know?</font>

214
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

215
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:35,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this...?</font>

216
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter...</font>

217
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:48,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...how you look at it...</font>

218
00:14:49,570 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...his Chakra is...</font>

219
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:53,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...too big!</font>

220
00:14:54,330 --> 00:14:57,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dosu, this half-dead bastard
is nothing to be scared of!</font>

221
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Zaku! Don't you understand?!</font>

222
00:15:00,830 --> 00:15:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of all of them...</font>

223
00:15:03,590 --> 00:15:05,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in one fell swoop!</font>

224
00:15:06,130 --> 00:15:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Super Sonic Slicing Wave!</font>

225
00:15:24,940 --> 00:15:27,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! He must have been blown to pieces.</font>

226
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Who did?
— Huh?!</font>

227
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zaku!</font>

228
00:15:38,370 --> 00:15:39,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast!</font>

229
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, he took in those two,
and in the blink of an eye.</font>

230
00:15:46,130 --> 00:15:47,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style!</font>

231
00:15:47,130 --> 00:15:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Phoenix Flower Jutsu!</font>

232
00:15:49,510 --> 00:15:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't push your luck!</font>

233
00:15:50,470 --> 00:15:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll blow them off!</font>

234
00:15:54,050 --> 00:15:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

235
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shuriken's in the fire?!</font>

236
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zaku, below you!</font>

237
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The quality of the Chakra
is completely different...</font>

238
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that really Sasuke-kun?</font>

239
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?
What in the world...?</font>

240
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:25,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like you're
proud of your arms...</font>

241
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

242
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop it!</font>

243
00:16:35,090 --> 00:16:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun will definitely come for me.</font>

244
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the only one left.</font>

245
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:06,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

246
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">make it a little more fun for me.</font>

247
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't...</font>

248
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:26,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't...</font>

249
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not like...</font>

250
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

251
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop!!</font>

252
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it.</font>

253
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

254
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop.</font>

255
00:18:26,870 --> 00:18:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark is withdrawing...</font>

256
00:18:29,330 --> 00:18:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're saved for now.</font>

257
00:18:32,090 --> 00:18:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

258
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're strong.</font>

259
00:18:43,510 --> 00:18:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... We can't defeat you
the way you are now.</font>

260
00:18:50,810 --> 00:18:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is our fee for settling this...</font>

261
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let us withdraw from here.</font>

262
00:18:55,230 --> 00:18:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

263
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems selfish, but we now have
something we need to confirm, too.</font>

264
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said,
let's make a promise.</font>

265
00:19:12,330 --> 00:19:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's another opportunity to
battle with you in this test,</font>

266
00:19:17,010 --> 00:19:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we won't run or hide.</font>

267
00:19:26,010 --> 00:19:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

268
00:19:28,850 --> 00:19:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who in the world is Orochimaru?</font>

269
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:33,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did he do to Sasuke-kun?!</font>

270
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why Sasuke-kun?!</font>

271
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

272
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were just given orders to
make the hit on Sasuke-kun.</font>

273
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though you ordered us to
assassinate Sasuke-kun,</font>

274
00:19:49,410 --> 00:19:52,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you got to him first.</font>

275
00:19:53,330 --> 00:19:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, you didn't kill him,
and left that Curse Mark instead.</font>

276
00:19:58,210 --> 00:20:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what you're thinking...</font>

277
00:20:12,190 --> 00:20:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Are you okay?!</font>

278
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pain, but Ino,
I'll leave Lee to you.</font>

279
00:20:16,730 --> 00:20:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.</font>

280
00:20:18,610 --> 00:20:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Chakra...
It's abnormal.</font>

281
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Uchiha clan...
this good, huh?</font>

282
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan's in danger!</font>

283
00:20:29,950 --> 00:20:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay...
I'll protect Sakura-chan.</font>

284
00:20:34,330 --> 00:20:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, what should we do
with this guy?</font>

285
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kick him awake?</font>

286
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I do it?</font>

287
00:20:44,430 --> 00:20:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I...?</font>

288
00:20:50,770 --> 00:20:51,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

289
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

290
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

291
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

292
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

293
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

294
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

296
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

298
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

299
00:21:42,950 --> 00:21:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

